- The authenticity of the communication end-points during the update process shall be ensured.
- The confidentiality of the communication between the end-points during the update process shall be ensured.
- The confidentiality of the firmware update shall be ensured during the transfer from the cloud to the CMC.
- Only authorized firmware shall be allowed to be installed at the CMC.', false),
